 1. Resolve checkpoint (`modelKey` → genre dispatch via `GENRE_MODEL_DISPATCH` → `DEFAULT_MODEL`) and lazy-load via `ModelRegistry`
 2. Tokenize context with the extended 359-vocab tokenizer (13 genre tokens)
